#
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
#
# 1. Create Telegram Bot:
#    - Open Telegram
#    - Search for @BotFather
#    - Send: /newbot
#    - Follow prompts to name your bot
#    - Copy the bot token (looks like: 123456789:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrsTUVwxyz)
#    - Paste above as: TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN="your-token-here"
#
# 2. Get Your Chat ID:
#    - Open Telegram
#    - Search for @userinfobot
#    - Send: /start
#    - Copy your ID (looks like: 123456789)
#    - Paste above as: TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID="your-id-here"
#
# 3. Start your bot:
#    - Search for your bot in Telegram
#    - Send: /start
#
# 4. Test:
#    python3 autonomous/telegram_notifier.py --test
#
# System will then send you notifications automatically!
